":"assigned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2017-10-17T01:10:47Z","assignee":{"login":"asimshankar","id":16018,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16018?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar","html_url":"https://github.com/asimshankar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tensorflow/tensorflow/issues/comments/337091767","html_url":"https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/issues/13764#issuecomment-337091767","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tensorflow/tensorflow/issues/13764","id":337091767,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMzNzA5MTc2Nw==","user":{"login":"asimshankar","id":16018,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16018?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar","html_url":"https://github.com/asimshankar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-10-17T01:38:26Z","updated_at":"2017-10-17T01:38:26Z","body":"Thanks for the report @vishvananda. I'm unable to reproduce the problem using the [1.3.0 release binary](\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tensorflow/libtensorflow/libtensorflow-gpu-linux-x86_64-1.3.0.tar.gz\"), or [1.4.0-rc0 release binary](https://storage.googleapis.com/tensorflow/libtensorflow/libtensorflow-gpu-linux-x86_64-1.3.0.tar.gz) (will try rebuilding from source using the exact flags you're using). Do you see the same problem when using the release binaries of the C API?\r\n\r\nWhich version of `go` are you using? Also, is it possible that `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` is somehow bringing in an older version of the C API libraries that your go program ends up using?\r\n\r\nIt should be okay for `TF_TensorData` to return `nil`.\r\n\r\nAny additional information in reproducing the environment will be helpful. (I'll try to dig into this a bit more by rebuilding from source using the command you provided above)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tensorflow/tensorflow/issues/comments/337091767/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"asimshankar","id":16018,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16018?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar","html_url":"https://github.com/asimshankar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asimshankar/followers","following_